  "core": "Source turns the wheel at the threshold — what enters here enters all positions. In Discipline, that entry works on the lantern itself: the light that guides deliberate work grows brighter or dimmer depending on what the wheel brings through. Unacknowledged, the source stays invisible — the practitioner tends the lamp without naming what feeds it, credits their own steadiness for what the threshold supplies.",
